000100*=================================================================
000200* PROGRAM-ID : FLB030
000300* 機能       : 請求書作成
000400* 処理概要   : 契約マスタを順に読み、請求区分ごとに請求書行を
000500*              印刷ファイルへ書き出します。あわせて請求実績を
000600*              更新ファイルへ残します。
000700* 起動元     : FLJ020 STEP010
000800* 呼び出し先 : なし
000900* 備考       : 初版からの構成を保っています。節と GO TO で
001000*              組み立てています。
001100*=================================================================
001200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001300 PROGRAM-ID.    FLB030.
001400 AUTHOR.        FL-BATCH-TEAM.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.  1998-10-01.
001600*
001700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001900 SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
002000 OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
002100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002200 FILE-CONTROL.
002300     SELECT KEIMST ASSIGN TO KEIMST
002400            ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002500            FILE STATUS  IS WS-KEI-ST.
002600     SELECT SEIKYU ASSIGN TO SEIKYU
002700            ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002800            FILE STATUS  IS WS-SEI-ST.
002900     SELECT KEIUPD ASSIGN TO KEIUPD
003000            ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
003100            FILE STATUS  IS WS-UPD-ST.
003200*
003300 DATA DIVISION.
003400 FILE SECTION.
003500 FD  KEIMST
003600     RECORDING MODE IS F
003700     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
003800     COPY FLC020.
003900*
004000 FD  SEIKYU
004100     RECORDING MODE IS F
004200     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
004300 01  SEIKYU-REC                     PIC X(132).
004400*
004500 FD  KEIUPD
004600     RECORDING MODE IS F
004700     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
004800 01  KEIUPD-REC                     PIC X(100).
004900*
005000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
005100*
005200 01  WS-FILE-STATUS.
005300     05  WS-KEI-ST                  PIC X(02) VALUE '00'.
005400     05  WS-SEI-ST                  PIC X(02) VALUE '00'.
005500     05  WS-UPD-ST                  PIC X(02) VALUE '00'.
005600*
005700 01  WS-FLAGS.
005800     05  WS-EOF                     PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
005900     05  WS-UPD-ERR                 PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
006000*
006100 01  WS-DATE-AREA.
006200     05  WS-DATE-X                  PIC X(08).
006300     05  WS-DATE-R REDEFINES WS-DATE-X PIC X(10).
006400*
006500 01  WS-AMOUNTS.
006600     05  WS-NYUKIN-GAKU             PIC S9(09) VALUE ZERO.
006700     05  WS-ZAN-GAKU                PIC 9(09) VALUE ZERO.         CHG22011
006800     05  WS-GOKEI                   PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE ZERO.
006900     05  WS-KENSU                   PIC 9(05) VALUE ZERO.
007000     05  WS-HEIKIN                  PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.
007100     05  WS-HEIKIN2                 PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.
007200     05  WS-PRT-CNT                 PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
007300     05  WS-UPD-CNT                 PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
007400     05  WS-RETRY-CNT               PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
007500*
007600 01  WS-INDEX-AREA.
007700     05  WS-IX                      PIC 9(03) VALUE 1.            CHG22011
007800*
007900 01  WS-SEIKYU-TBL.
008000     05  WS-SEIKYU-ENT OCCURS 100 TIMES.
008100         10  WS-SEIKYU-KBN2         PIC X(01).
008200         10  WS-SEIKYU-KIN          PIC S9(09) COMP-3.
008300*
008400 01  WS-EDIT-AREA.
008500     05  WS-SEIKYU-KBN              PIC X(01) VALUE SPACE.
008600     05  WS-KBN-MEI                 PIC X(20) VALUE SPACE.
008700     05  WS-TOK-MEI                 PIC X(20) VALUE SPACE.
008800     05  WS-MIDASHI                 PIC X(40) VALUE SPACE.
008900     05  WS-UPD-KEY                 PIC X(10) VALUE SPACE.
009000 01  WS-ERR-MSG                     PIC X(60) VALUE SPACE.
009100*
009200 01  WS-GOKEI-LINE.
009300     05  FILLER                     PIC X(12) VALUE '請求合計  '.
009400     05  WS-GOKEI-PRT               PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
009500     05  FILLER                     PIC X(105) VALUE SPACE.
009600*
009700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
009800*
009900*----- 主処理 ----------------------------------------------------
010000 0000-MAIN SECTION.
010100 0000-MAIN-RTN.
010200     DISPLAY 'FLB030 請求書作成を開始します。'.
010300     PERFORM 1000-INIT.
010400     PERFORM 2000-SHORI.
010500     PERFORM 3000-PRINT.
010600     PERFORM 4000-UPDATE.
010700     PERFORM 8000-END.
010800     STOP RUN.
010900*
011000 8900-OLD-SUMMARY.
011100     DISPLAY '旧集計処理を通りました。'.
011200     MOVE ZERO TO WS-GOKEI.
011300     MOVE ZERO TO WS-KENSU.
011400     STOP RUN.
011500*
011600*----- 初期処理 --------------------------------------------------
011700 1000-INIT SECTION.
011800 1000-INIT-RTN.
011900     OPEN INPUT KEIMST.
012000     IF WS-KEI-ST NOT = '00'
012100         MOVE '契約マスタを開けませんでした' TO WS-ERR-MSG
012200         PERFORM 9000-ABEND.
012300     OPEN OUTPUT SEIKYU.
012400     IF WS-SEI-ST NOT = '00'
012500         MOVE '請求書ファイルを開けませんでした' TO WS-ERR-MSG
012600         PERFORM 9000-ABEND.
012700     OPEN OUTPUT KEIUPD.
012800     IF WS-UPD-ST NOT = '00'
012900         MOVE '更新ファイルを開けませんでした' TO WS-ERR-MSG
013000         PERFORM 9000-ABEND.
013100     ACCEPT WS-DATE-X FROM DATE YYYYMMDD.
013200     MOVE ZERO TO WS-KENSU.
013300     MOVE ZERO TO WS-GOKEI.
013400     MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF.
013500     MOVE 1 TO WS-IX.
013600*
013700*----- 明細処理 --------------------------------------------------
013800 2000-SHORI SECTION.
013900 2000-SHORI-RTN.
014000     MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF.
014100*
014200 2100-LOOP.
014300     READ KEIMST AT END GO TO 2900-EOF.
014400     IF WS-KEI-ST NOT = '00' AND WS-KEI-ST NOT = '10'
014500         MOVE '契約マスタの読み込みに失敗しました' TO WS-ERR-MSG
014600         PERFORM 9000-ABEND.
014700     ADD 1 TO WS-KENSU.
014800     ADD FLC2-SEIKYU-GAKU TO WS-GOKEI.
014900     MOVE FLC2-SEIKYU-KBN TO WS-SEIKYU-KBN.
015000     SUBTRACT WS-NYUKIN-GAKU FROM FLC2-SEIKYU-GAKU
015100         GIVING WS-ZAN-GAKU.
015200     EVALUATE WS-SEIKYU-KBN
015300         WHEN '1'
015400             MOVE '通常請求' TO WS-KBN-MEI
015500         WHEN '2'
015600             MOVE '一括請求' TO WS-KBN-MEI.
015700     EVALUATE FLC2-TOKUSOKU-KBN
015800         WHEN '0'
015900             MOVE '督促なし' TO WS-TOK-MEI
016000         WHEN '1'
016100             MOVE '一次督促' TO WS-TOK-MEI
016200         WHEN OTHER
016300             MOVE '要確認' TO WS-TOK-MEI.
016400     MOVE FLC2-SEIKYU-GAKU TO WS-SEIKYU-KIN (WS-IX).
016500     MOVE FLC2-SEIKYU-KBN TO WS-SEIKYU-KBN2 (WS-IX).
016600     IF WS-IX < 100
016700         ADD 1 TO WS-IX.
016800     IF WS-ZAN-GAKU > ZERO
016900         GO TO 3400-PRINT-LINE.
017000     GO TO 2100-LOOP.
017100*
017200 2900-EOF.
017300     CLOSE KEIMST.
017400     COMPUTE WS-HEIKIN = WS-GOKEI / WS-KENSU.
017500     IF WS-KENSU NOT = ZERO
017600         COMPUTE WS-HEIKIN2 = WS-GOKEI / WS-KENSU
017700             ON SIZE ERROR MOVE ZERO TO WS-HEIKIN2.
017800*
017900 9999-EXIT.
018000     EXIT.
018100*
018200*----- 請求書の印刷 ----------------------------------------------
018300 3000-PRINT SECTION.
018400 3000-PRINT-RTN.
018500     MOVE 1 TO WS-IX.
018600     ALTER 3100-SW TO PROCEED TO 3300-SECOND.                     CHG22011
018700*
018800 3100-SW.
018900     GO TO 3200-FIRST.
019000*
019100 3200-FIRST.
019200     MOVE '請求書（初回発行）' TO WS-MIDASHI.
019300     GO TO 3400-PRINT-LINE.
019400*
019500 3300-SECOND.
019600     MOVE '請求書（再発行）' TO WS-MIDASHI.
019700*
019800 3400-PRINT-LINE.
019900     MOVE SPACE TO SEIKYU-REC.
020000     MOVE WS-MIDASHI TO SEIKYU-REC.
020100     WRITE SEIKYU-REC.
020200     IF WS-SEI-ST NOT = '00'
020300         MOVE '請求書の書き込みに失敗しました' TO WS-ERR-MSG
020400         PERFORM 9000-ABEND.
020500     ADD 1 TO WS-PRT-CNT.
020600*
020700 3900-EXIT.
020800     EXIT.
020900*
021000 3500-PRINT-GOKEI.
021100     MOVE WS-GOKEI TO WS-GOKEI-PRT.
021200     MOVE WS-GOKEI-LINE TO SEIKYU-REC.
021300     WRITE SEIKYU-REC.
021400     IF WS-SEI-ST NOT = '00'
021500         MOVE '合計行の書き込みに失敗しました' TO WS-ERR-MSG
021600         PERFORM 9000-ABEND.
021700*
021800 3900-EXIT.
021900     EXIT.
022000*
022100*----- 請求実績の更新 --------------------------------------------
022200 4000-UPDATE SECTION.
022300 4000-UPDATE-RTN.
022400     MOVE 'N' TO WS-UPD-ERR.
022500     PERFORM 4000-UPD THRU 4000-UPD-EXIT.
022600     IF WS-UPD-ERR = 'Y'
022700         PERFORM 4900-RETRY.
022800     GO TO 4000-UPDATE-EXIT.
022900*
023000 4000-UPD.
023100     MOVE FLC2-KEIYAKU-NO TO WS-UPD-KEY.
023200*
023300 4100-UPD-WRITE.
023400     MOVE SPACE TO KEIUPD-REC.
023500     MOVE WS-UPD-KEY TO KEIUPD-REC.
023600     WRITE KEIUPD-REC.
023700     IF WS-UPD-ST NOT = '00'
023800         MOVE 'Y' TO WS-UPD-ERR.
023900     ADD 1 TO WS-UPD-CNT.
024000*
024100 4000-UPD-EXIT.
024200     EXIT.
024300*
024400 4900-RETRY.
024500     ADD 1 TO WS-RETRY-CNT.
024600     MOVE 'N' TO WS-UPD-ERR.
024700     GO TO 4100-UPD-WRITE.
024800*
024900 4000-UPDATE-EXIT.
025000     EXIT.
025100*
025200*----- 終了処理 --------------------------------------------------
025300 8000-END SECTION.
025400 8000-END-RTN.
025500     CLOSE SEIKYU.
025600     CLOSE KEIUPD.
025700     DISPLAY 'FLB030 請求書作成を終了します。'.
025800     DISPLAY '  読込件数 = ' WS-KENSU.
025900     DISPLAY '  印刷件数 = ' WS-PRT-CNT.
026000     DISPLAY '  更新件数 = ' WS-UPD-CNT.
026100     DISPLAY '  平均金額 = ' WS-HEIKIN.
026200     MOVE ZERO TO RETURN-CODE.
026300*
026400 9999-EXIT.
026500     EXIT.
026600*
026700*----- 異常終了 --------------------------------------------------
026800 9000-ABEND SECTION.
026900 9000-ABEND-RTN.
027000     DISPLAY 'FLB030 異常終了しました。'.
027100     DISPLAY '  内容 : ' WS-ERR-MSG.
027200     MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE.
027300     STOP RUN.
